        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion W1, Modern Skyline Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Skyline Handleset was made to grace Fifth Avenue; but even if you don't live in the big apple, this modern handleset is perfect to bring New York City glamour to any home. It is available as a single cylinder handleset which means that it has a keyed lock on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside. Choose from your favorite inside trim, we particularly like it with the empire lever (pictured). Available in brushed nickel, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze. It features an easy installation with reversible latch bolts. Made out of solid brass, it will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/skyline-rectangular-entry-plate-fusion-e-v9\">Matching Skyline Entryset</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Solid Brass Skyline Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion W1 Skyline Modern Front Door Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2 on center door boring</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Skyline Handleset, Fusion W1",
                "description": "Fusion W1, Skyline Handlesets -- The Skyline Handleset was made to grace Fifth Avenue; but even if you don't live in the big apple, this modern handleset is perfect to bring New York City glamour to any home. It is available as a single cylinder handleset which means that it has a keyed lock on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside. Choose from your favorite inside trim, we particularly like it with the empire lever (pictured). Available in brushed nickel, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze. It features an easy installation with reversible latch bolts. Made out of solid brass, it will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "FUS-W1, Modern Skyline Door Entry Handlesets, Skyline Handlesets, Fusion W1 modern handlesets, modern front door pulls, single cylinder handlesets, dummy cylinder handlesets, Fusion W1 Skyline Modern Front Door Handlesets, Solid Brass Skyline Door Handles"
